message: "If you use study-kit in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "study-kit: grounded study websites and validated study materials as an agent skill"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Spinaci
    given-names: Gianmarco
    affiliation: "Università di Bologna"
version: 0.3.0
date-released: 2026-10-29
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/gspinaci/study-kit"
keywords:
  - agent skills
  - spaced repetition
  - Anki
  - learning design
  - curriculum grounding
abstract: >
  An agent skill that turns an authoritative source (book, chapter, paper or syllabus)
  into a study path and modular study materials — objectives, a styled Anki deck,
  notebooks, quizzes, glossaries and readings — all hooked onto chapter objectives,
  grounded in the source or in verified syllabi, and checked by a deterministic validator.
